        "rationale": "The 3 is in the $5^2 = 25$ column, so it is worth $3 \\times 25 = 75$."
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "content": "$300$",
        "rationale": "That would be its value in base ten, where the third place is hundreds."
      },
      {
