        "content": "$15$",
        "rationale": "The 3 is in the twenty-fives column, not the fives column."
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "content": "$3$",
        "rationale": "The digit's value depends on its place, not just the digit."
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "In base five the place values from the right are $1, 5, 25, 125$. The 3 is in the twenty-fives place, so it stands for $3 \\times 25 = 75$.",
